{
  "format": "quantlabs-blueprint-library",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "recipe-monthly-sample",
      "title": "Receta · mensual → coordenada → centrado → Scatter",
      "area": "Herramientas · recetas modulares",
      "description": "Reproduce resample(ME).last(), linspace(-2,2), resta de media y puntos; no requiere entrenar un modelo.",
      "instructions": [
        "Datos sintéticos por defecto; cambia Market Data a yfinance para EURUSD=X real.",
        "Cada operación es un nodo reutilizable independiente. El gráfico se obtiene sin Curve Fitting.",
        "Centrado fit_fraction=1 reproduce la resta de media de toda la muestra: es descriptivo, no evaluación temporal. Close original se conserva.",
        "Cambia rango, frecuencia, columna, prefijo y gráfico en el inspector. Para entrenar conecta Coordenada a Curve Fitting y configura la arquitectura; no conectes una muestra descriptiva a Risk Metrics."
      ],
      "graph": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "Datos",
            "type": "blueprint",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 100
            },
            "data": {
              "kind": "source",
              "label": "Datos",
              "params": {
                "source": "synthetic",
                "ticker": "EURUSD=X",
                "years": 15
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "Seleccionar",
            "type": "blueprint",
            "position": {
              "x": 300,
              "y": 100
            },
            "data": {
              "kind": "select_columns",
              "label": "Seleccionar",
              "params": {
                "columns": "Close"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "Mensual",
            "type": "blueprint",
            "position": {
              "x": 600,
              "y": 100
            },
            "data": {
              "kind": "resample",
              "label": "Mensual",
              "params": {
                "columns": "Close",
                "frequency": "ME",
                "aggregation": "last",
                "exclude_incomplete": false
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "Coordenada",
            "type": "blueprint",
            "position": {
              "x": 900,
              "y": 100
            },
            "data": {
              "kind": "coordinate",
              "label": "Coordenada",
              "params": {
                "start": -2,
                "stop": 2,
                "output_column": "Coordinate"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "Centrar",
            "type": "blueprint",
            "position": {
              "x": 1200,
              "y": 100
            },
            "data": {
              "kind": "center",
              "label": "Centrar",
              "params": {
                "columns": "Close",
                "prefix": "Centered_",
                "fit_fraction": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "Muestra",
            "type": "blueprint",
            "position": {
              "x": 1500,
              "y": 100
            },
            "data": {
              "kind": "plot",
              "label": "Muestra",
              "params": {
                "plot_source": "columns",
                "chart_type": "scatter",
                "x_column": "Coordinate",
                "plot_columns": "Centered_Close",
                "title": "Sample Data Set · sin entrenamiento",
                "color": "Coral"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "edges": [
          {
            "id": "Datos-Seleccionar",
            "source": "Datos",
            "target": "Seleccionar",
            "sourceHandle": "frame",
            "targetHandle": "frame",
            "animated": true
          },
          {
